      "content": "Smart contract interface for the Auditor, the central risk management component of Exactly Protocol. Manages market listings, collateral factors, account liquidity checks, and liquidation eligibility. Provides methods to query all markets, compute account liquidity, calculate seizure amounts, and check liquidation conditions. Deployed on Ethereum, Optimism, and Base.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Exactly Protocol",
